      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Navigating conflicting reports online is challenging because both narratives can contain elements of truth depending on which source you trust. To gauge stability, focus on reports detailing government responses, such as curfews, increased military presence, or widespread policy changes, rather than just protest motivations. A measurable, forceful response suggests a firm government stance, while escalating, decentralized unrest indicates a deeper systemic challenge. For your safety, always prioritize real-time security updates over polarized commentary.",
